### Get my invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get my invoice detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin get all invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin get invoice detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices/6
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin cancel unpaid invoice
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "Member hủy đăng ký trước khi thanh toán"
}

### Admin filter invoices by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices?status=UNPAID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin filter invoices by member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices?memberId=6
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin filter invoices by member and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices?memberId=6&status=UNPAID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin generate invoice manually
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "subscriptionId": 6,
  "note": "Tạo invoice thủ công cho subscription chưa có hóa đơn"
}

### Admin get payments by invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invoices/6/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json